## Memory Optimization Strategies

### Advanced Memory Coalescing

```cuda
// memory_coalescing_optimized.cu - Advanced coalescing patterns
__global__ void optimized_transpose(
    float* input, float* output,
    int width, int height
) {
    // Optimized tile size to minimize bank conflicts
    __shared__ float tile[32][33]; // +1 for bank conflict avoidance

    // Calculate indices with coalescing in mind
