# Aggregate Design: NetworkDef + InferenceBuffer

## Current Problem
```rust
// Current: Network owns both topology AND runtime state
pub struct Network<T> {
    pub layers: Vec<Layer<T>>,    // topology + weights + neuron values (mixed)
    pub connection_rate: f32,
}

